Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.37,0:00:06.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）哈鲁特！哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.93,0:00:14.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.84,0:00:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特在哪！？消失到哪去了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.06,0:00:23.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈……哈鲁特大人的行踪，目前
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.51,0:00:25.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈修大人和德罗瓦大人……
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到哈鲁特了吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.02,0:00:35.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}戈修！德罗瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.71,0:00:37.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（戈修）啧，我都说了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你闭嘴，是谁！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.64,0:00:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是谁告诉快斗的！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.00,0:00:44.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}[屏幕]（快斗）为什么沉默！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:46.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}回答我！戈修！德罗瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:50.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么？因为太吵了这还用说吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:51.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（德罗瓦）放心吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.99,0:00:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已确认哈鲁特平安无事。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.36,0:00:55.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦！？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.39,0:00:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是还没能将他保护起来。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.33,0:01:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为此，快斗，需要你的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.35,0:01:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特现在
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.83,0:01:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在湾区风车塔的屋顶上。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.86,0:01:12.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和名叫九十九游马的少年在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.14,0:01:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.52,0:01:15.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}打算叫他来吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.35,0:01:17.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是什么气氛啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.39,0:01:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}忘了哈鲁特的力量了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:24.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}照现在这样我们根本无法接近那个孩子。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:31.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗是哈鲁特唯一敞开心扉的存在。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.08,0:01:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是他的话哈鲁特一定会乖乖听话。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.38,0:01:36.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.89,0:01:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《风车塔…》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((来。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.82,0:01:53.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是焦糖哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.38,0:01:56.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是能让人打起精神的魔法糖果。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.67,0:02:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好甜…非常甜哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.39,0:02:05.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特，一直在一起。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.35,0:02:13.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！哈鲁特！！))
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.82,0:02:15.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《在那个地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且还跟九十九游马一起！？》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.23,0:02:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((游马：喂…喂 哈鲁特！你…。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.68,0:02:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（V）哈鲁特大人也 再次似乎在渴求我。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.30,0:02:31.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的使命是摧毁星光体世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特！！))
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.43,0:04:13.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛 总之不是挺好的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那家伙好像是哈鲁特的熟人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）嗯 是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.77,0:04:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定是那个叫快斗的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.54,0:04:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}派来接你的呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.93,0:04:28.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗…。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.28,0:04:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((哥哥他…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.37,0:04:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥为了我{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:37.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}非常疲惫。 所以{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.99,0:04:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以想让哥哥吃……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想吃焦糖……
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.56,0:04:47.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}果然，那家伙……快斗他{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.22,0:04:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了春人拼命地在收集 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.07,0:04:54.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.61,0:04:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙非得收集
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:05:00.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡的理由是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.43,0:05:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((我的使命是摧毁星光体世界))
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（星光体）那到底是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.07,0:05:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:15.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}载着春人君的直升机！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你……你是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.07,0:05:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这小鬼！把春人弄哪去了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊！春人的话不是已经让他回家了吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.06,0:05:28.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.13,0:05:30.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有人来接他了啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.16,0:05:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你没听说吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.77,0:05:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你们的同伴吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:38.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才那架直升机上也有和那个一样的标记！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.95,0:05:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}听到了吗？德罗瓦。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:44.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咕哈！\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.26,0:05:44.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:47.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}负责搜寻哈鲁特的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}应该只有我们这支队伍才对。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}满口胡言还挺来劲啊小子！嘿！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.95,0:05:57.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛！哇啊 好痛痛痛痛！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:05:59.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.61,0:06:01.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老实把哈鲁特交出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.92,0:06:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不然的话！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.03,0:06:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我没说谎！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.91,0:06:11.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呃！咕哈～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特我已经好好还回去了！你们
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:18.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没资格对我指手画脚！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.91,0:06:22.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙 越来越来劲了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇～！放开 放开我！！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我听好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.68,0:06:30.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们是决斗嘉年华运营委员。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.44,0:06:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这样让你失去参赛资格
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.98,0:06:35.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也是有可能的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可恶～！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不想这样的话就老实说。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你把春人弄到哪去了！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:44.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊　那个是！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.39,0:06:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}着陆！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在哪？在哪！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.83,0:06:59.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}春人在哪！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.13,0:07:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.09,0:07:05.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂　快斗！这帮家伙以为是我把春人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.72,0:07:08.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}藏到什么地方去了他们就是这么想的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.13,0:07:10.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}藏了春人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:11.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.40,0:07:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我明明是把春人交给了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.37,0:07:15.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从心园来迎接的人…。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:18.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从心园来迎接的！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.09,0:07:18.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.77,0:07:21.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这么说的话　那…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:51.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那到底是怎么回事啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}谁…　是谁把哈鲁特！？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:56.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别装傻！　你这蠢货！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.77,0:07:58.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你　把哈鲁特大人掳走的吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.78,0:08:00.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}滚一边去。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.16,0:08:01.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵　遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:04.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说是心园派来迎接的人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:05.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个什么样的人？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:05.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.90,0:08:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙有什么特征？　男的？　女的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.10,0:08:09.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}男的！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.99,0:08:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这些！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.77,0:08:13.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是个年轻男人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.09,0:08:15.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大概20岁　身材偏瘦{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:17.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.19,0:08:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}身高　185厘米体重　70公斤左右。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对了！身高185厘米！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.23,0:08:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}体重70公斤！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.84,0:08:29.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}头发很长，还有一双蓝色的眼睛。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}头发很长，呃……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.21,0:08:33.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}眼睛是什么颜色来着？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.78,0:08:35.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，别胡说八道！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.73,0:08:37.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手，高修！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:38.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吵死了！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:40.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我才不听你的指挥！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.08,0:08:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}高修！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.26,0:08:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德罗瓦！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.44,0:08:44.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连你也觉得刚才那套
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.51,0:08:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}乱七八糟的描述能接受吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.49,0:08:47.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我并不接受。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.83,0:08:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是，至少{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:53.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他没有说谎这件事似乎是确实的。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.41,0:08:55.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}走了！高修！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.03,0:08:58.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}带走哈鲁的男人，另有其人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.08,0:08:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧！没办法。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.97,0:09:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.82,0:09:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.15,0:09:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉，是我没有好好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.15,0:09:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确认清楚，才让哈鲁……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁他……那家伙生病了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}病气？\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎！？\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}生病？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.11,0:09:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等！快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.07,0:09:32.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁被带走是我的责任。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.82,0:09:35.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也要去找哈鲁！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.07,0:09:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}跟你没关系。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.11,0:09:42.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗，我跟哈鲁约好了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.15,0:09:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一定会让你见到他！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.12,0:09:50.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}轨道。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.67,0:09:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.22,0:09:54.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}要是找到了就联系我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.33,0:09:55.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这个笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.11,0:10:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们对于生病的哈鲁君对不认识的人……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.82,0:10:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((快斗 为什么你会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:27.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去收集什么 No.卡啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.81,0:10:30.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么 要做那种像恶魔爪牙一样的事……？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.73,0:10:37.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我……是为了弟弟才把灵魂卖给了恶魔))
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗收集 No.卡{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.45,0:10:43.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和哈鲁特的病有关系吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.77,0:10:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有 把灵魂卖给恶魔这件事也…… 可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.18,0:10:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底是怎么回事啊！？恶魔。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}目前知道的 只有德鲁瓦和戈什也{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.10,0:10:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在找哈鲁特这件事而已。哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:11:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}德鲁瓦和戈什也是不是也受某人的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.21,0:11:02.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在找哈鲁特呢……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.39,0:11:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又或者 是发生了什么纠纷
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.22,0:11:06.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让哈鲁特逃走了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了掩盖那个失误而慌忙……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们是决斗嘉年华的运营委员{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.76,0:11:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大会主办者　心园先生的部下。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.78,0:11:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那帮家伙是心园的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.10,0:11:25.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}恐怕他们之所以在找哈鲁{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.07,0:11:27.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是为了心园先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁是从心园的管理之下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.81,0:11:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逃出来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.07,0:11:33.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}逃出来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说快斗是为了哈鲁{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.18,0:11:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在心园先生的命令下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:40.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}收集 No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.73,0:11:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也就是说　那个恶魔是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.87,0:11:45.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园先生。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.14,0:11:54.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:55.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.71,0:11:59.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是　带走哈鲁的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.63,0:12:01.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既不是德罗瓦也不是戈修。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.70,0:12:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。问题在于除了他们之外{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.79,0:12:07.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有盯上哈鲁特的人存在这件事。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.69,0:12:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙，到底是谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.50,0:12:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，开始仪式吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.48,0:12:40.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《在哪？你在哪，哈鲁特？》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:46.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《回答我》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.59,0:12:50.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《哈鲁特！》
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.41,0:13:12.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}((找到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:16.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:17.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥果然好厉害。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.75,0:13:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不管我躲到哪里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.14,0:13:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你都能马上找到我呢))
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.94,0:13:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.94,0:13:28.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这次我也绝对会找到你。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.73,0:13:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以喊吧。喊我的名字。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.71,0:13:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）来吧，终于到时候了。将哈鲁特的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.69,0:13:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}据为己有的时刻到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.85,0:14:09.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.29,0:14:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在 从这一瞬间起我的复仇开始了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:20.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等着吧 Dr.菲卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.24,0:14:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦哦 这就是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.54,0:14:35.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这就是星光体世界。 多么美丽。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}感觉到了。 我感觉到了。 哈鲁特的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.49,0:14:46.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜呜……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:53.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手。 啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（托隆）就是这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.87,0:15:08.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这正是我所追求的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.85,0:15:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好厉害。 太棒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.82,0:15:17.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.65,0:15:21.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才的声音 是哈鲁特！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.72,0:15:24.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么了 星光体？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.06,0:15:26.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特。 哈鲁特他。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.74,0:15:29.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.15,0:15:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特君发生什么事了？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.69,0:15:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（哈鲁特）救我。 救我 哥哥。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.51,0:15:45.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥 呜……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，是哈鲁特。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.66,0:15:50.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特在痛苦挣扎。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇～！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.27,0:15:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太棒了。太棒了，这股力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.39,0:16:02.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特，把这份力量全部变成我的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥，哥哥。啊～。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.07,0:16:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.06,0:16:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特。你在哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:18.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说话啊。哈鲁特，回答我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.75,0:16:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥。水中的月亮。白色的城堡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.98,0:16:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水中的月亮。白色的城堡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.67,0:16:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真的是哈鲁特这么说的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，确实说了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.19,0:16:46.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水中的月亮，白色的城堡。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.78,0:16:52.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水中的月亮，白色的城堡，这到底是？到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.98,0:16:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}水中的月亮。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:17:01.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}城外现在有一座已经废弃不用的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:04.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}美术馆对吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.03,0:17:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯。这个　白色城堡说的不就是这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.23,0:17:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}原来如此！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.11,0:17:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以　水中的月亮指的就是{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.94,0:17:17.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}映在这片湖里的月亮　一定是这样。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.32,0:17:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞～！　就是那个。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:21.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然确定了就出发吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.95,0:17:26.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！　快斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:28.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（鲨鱼）快斗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.44,0:17:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这里　遥他…。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.43,0:17:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遥。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.83,0:17:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.43,0:17:44.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.43,0:17:47.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}遥就在那里面。　绝对没错。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:50.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙　为什么　会知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.11,0:17:52.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总…　总之　我就是知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.91,0:17:54.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你知道什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.35,0:17:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}又不是兄弟的你　对遥能知道什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.31,0:18:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥～！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.07,0:18:05.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，哈特他很痛苦。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.49,0:18:09.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，快斗，现在不是在这种地方争执的时候！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）来了啊。比想象中要快呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.78,0:18:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没被跟踪吧？{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.16,0:18:19.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅴ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）不可能。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘛，反正那些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}迟早都得碾碎。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.74,0:18:25.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}早晚都一样，是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.94,0:18:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就，上吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.08,0:18:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别太勉强。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:34.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊？你是想说我打不倒那些家伙吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗是强敌。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.10,0:18:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别执着于打倒他。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.39,0:18:40.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要拖到托隆的仪式结束{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}争取到时间那就行了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.28,0:18:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哼，一旦开始了可就说不准了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.76,0:18:49.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也没法保证那些家伙的命。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:52.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.80,0:18:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅲ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）好的，V哥哥大人。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.47,0:19:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来他们似乎愿意迎接我们进去。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.09,0:19:18.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。那就从正面堂堂正正地闯进去！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.73,0:19:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.41,0:19:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙给我回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.45,0:19:25.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗……我怎么可能回去啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.40,0:19:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把遥人交到除你以外的人手里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.67,0:19:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的，就是我。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.41,0:19:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以在把遥人平安还给你之前{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.46,0:19:35.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不可能回去！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.91,0:19:37.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔……。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.98,0:20:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}～
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.82,0:20:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}Ⅳ{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}）哈哈哈哈！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.14,0:20:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于见到你了，快斗。我可是一直在等你。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是 IV！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.61,0:20:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.72,0:20:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}～
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:30.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊… 啊…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你那边是来为同伴复仇的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.79,0:20:36.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好啊 随时奉陪。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.49,0:20:38.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别让憎恨夺走你的心。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一旦被憎恨囚禁决斗就会乱掉。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.93,0:20:47.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.97,0:20:51.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会把决斗用在复仇这种事上。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:53.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你们把哈鲁特掳走的吗！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.87,0:20:55.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈鲁特在哪！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.11,0:20:57.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他还活着，所以没事哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}至少现在是。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.06,0:21:02.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！？但是可不能就这么放你回去。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.93,0:21:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在正忙着呢。呵。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}即便如此如果你说想救弟弟的话……
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.11,0:21:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就先打倒我们再说吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是……双人决斗吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.40,0:21:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧。一飞冲天啊，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.60,0:21:25.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}敢对哈特动手的家伙我绝对不会原谅。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:28.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜噢噢～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}♪♪{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}～
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.11,0:21:47.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:53.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我来猎杀吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.47,0:21:55.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连同你们的灵魂一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.82,0:22:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}AR影像 连接完成。
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.41,0:22:02.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（大家）决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:08.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哥哥～！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.43,0:24:12.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说到心园的象征
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.64,0:24:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是Mr.心园了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.80,0:24:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}心园的Mr.心园这说法
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.56,0:24:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真够绕的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.41,0:24:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}意思重复的词这世上 多得是。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.44,0:24:21.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}泡菜锅 莎莎酱。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.46,0:24:23.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.02,0:24:24.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个别说。

